  "content": "<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>FPS 提升模组</strong></pre><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1072962/description_4f2caf77-6224-4b4f-a2d3-eae6e388496b.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"244\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本模组可提升游戏<span style=\"color:#3598db\">性能表现</span>与<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">稳定性</span>，并新增多项功能，例如<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">画面缩放</span>及闲置时自动降低FPS以<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">节省电力</span>。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>2.0版本警告：此为全面代码重构版本，若遭遇程式错误请务必回报</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://www.minecraft-france.fr/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"82\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://minecraftfacile.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/logo-forge.jpg\" alt=\"How to install and use Forge in Minecraft (step-by-step) – The Minecrafter\" width=\"398\" height=\"67\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">支援协助 :<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7qhfqERhS7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://logos-world.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Discord-Logo.png\" alt=\"Discord Logo, symbol, meaning, history, PNG, brand\" width=\"78\" height=\"44\">连结</a></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>模组启用前后对比<br></strong></pre><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">FPS : ~91&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; FPS : ~120</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1072962/description_956fa9bf-4f16-4e77-bc7b-94266fb4bf6c.png\" width=\"385\" height=\"202\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1072962/description_08506585-42cb-46bb-b023-8d57b8c7ab44.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"202\"></p><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>设定选项</strong></pre><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">停用天气</span> :&nbsp; &nbsp; </span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 关闭降雨效果</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">重载区块</span> :&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 重新载入已生成区块</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">缓慢运算</span> :&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;降低世界运算频率以减少CPU负载</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">禁用实体生成</span> :</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;禁止实体生成（新区块生成时仍可能出现实体）</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">实体清理</span> :&nbsp; </span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每3分钟清除地面所有掉落物</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">实体优化</span> :&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; 减少世界中实体数量</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">显示FPS</span> :&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在画面顶端显示FPS数值</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">清理通知</span> :&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 启用或停用实体清理相关视觉提示</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">萤幕保护</span> :&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;挂机超过1分钟后启动萤幕保护程式以降低电脑功耗</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#34495e\">画面缩放</span><span style=\"color:#34495e\"> :</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 按C键（可自定义）启动缩放功能，较Optifine更强大，可透过I/O键调整缩放层级</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">节能模式</span> :</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;游戏处于后台或玩家无操作时自动降低FPS，可减少能耗并提升后台执行Minecraft时的系统效能</p><p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>⚠️本模组需搭配依赖项 TCTCore ⚠️</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1064329/description_3fbde43e-996c-4363-83ce-ed278caf2d56.png\" width=\"229\" height=\"229\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tct-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载连结</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>按H键开启模组选单</strong></pre><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1072962/description_668ecb56-9d8e-485b-81be-aa0f14ea216d.png\" width=\"618\" height=\"318\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>注意事项<br></strong></pre><p style=\"text-align:center\">⚠️本模组专为配备入门级设备的玩家节省系统资源，结合Optifine使用可最大化提升游戏流畅度，确保获得最佳性能体验⚠️</p>\n\n（注：根据繁体中文用语习惯调整了专业术语表述，如\"模组\"对应Mod、\"画面\"对应Screen、\"挂机\"对应AFK、\"区块\"对应Chunk等，同时保留了所有HTML格式与超连结结构）",
